# Frontend

This directory is a placeholder for the frontend application.

## Setup

Use the [frontend-react](https://github.com/{{ author_name }}/templates) Copier template to scaffold a React frontend into this directory:

```sh
copier copy --trust path/to/templates/frontend-react src/{{ package_name }}/web/frontend
```

## Development

After scaffolding, the frontend dev server runs independently:

```sh
# Start backend
just dev-be

# Start frontend (in a separate terminal)
just dev-fe

# Or start both
just dev
```

## Production

Build the frontend for production:

```sh
cd src/{{ package_name }}/web/frontend && pnpm run build
```

The built files in `dist/` are served by FastAPI via `web/serve.py`.
